           its x and y strength are what match it to this game */
        if (rc.sx != null) { rc.sx = Math.round(nOr(rc.sx, 1) * fx * 1000) / 1000; }
        if (rc.sy != null) { rc.sy = Math.round(nOr(rc.sy, 1) * fy * 1000) / 1000; }
      }
      res.scaled = true;
    }
    a.madeWith = copy(to);
    return res;
  }

  /* D432 (owner, 2026-10-22: "when someone copies a config to send to
     someone, we can see the settings they had and use math to scale it to the
     new profile"). A pasted config arrives with its maker's gameSettings.
     When this player already said theirs for that game, its Scripts are
     scaled to them now and the config takes the player's settings. When they
